== Description ==

'''Rubber''' is a raw material in ''[[Human Host]]'', harvested from the world (trees, rocks, salvage). It appears as an ingredient in 10 downstream recipes at 3 different workbenches, including [[Wheel]], [[Electric Motor Engine]], [[Bicycle Generator]], [[Flexible Rotor]], [[Rotor]], [[Simple Motor]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

